    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d265">

                <pb facs="0381" n="275" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg275"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Peking,
                                China</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-05-14"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 14, 1906</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 307.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to confirm your cipher
                    telegram received April 29.<anchor n="a" xml:id="d265-f1"/></p>
                <p>I have drawn up a form following closely the British bond and sent it to Mr.
                    Moir, the American delegate on the bankers’ commission in Shanghai. I have asked
                    him to make the necessary calculations and have the form printed as soon as
                    possible. When received I will forward it to the department for approval and
                    verification of the figures.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Rockhill.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
